{"id":"5f2808a4af09ff40","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map.md","title":"ZFC Fun Currying Map","display":"df-zfc-fun-currying-map — ZFC Fun Currying Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map","58-df-zfc-map-currying-map"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-currying-map — ZFC Fun Currying Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-map-currying-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-currying-map — ZFC Fun Currying Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in V\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in V\\)</span> (source and target sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq(X\\times Y)\\times Z\">\\(f\\subseteq(X\\times Y)\\times Z\\)</span> (uncurried function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\subseteq X\\times Z^Y\">\\(c\\subseteq X\\times Z^Y\\)</span> (curried function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{Y,Z}\\in V\">\\(F_{Y,Z}\\in V\\)</span> (set of function graphs from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_{Y,Z}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[F_{Y,Z}=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(Y\\times Z):\\mathrm{Function}(u,Y,Z)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X\\times Y,Z)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,X,F_{Y,Z})\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(c(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_{Y,Z}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[F_{Y,Z}=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(Y\\times Z):\\mathrm{Function}(u,Y,Z)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X\\times Y,Z)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,X,F_{Y,Z})\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(c(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Currying changes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to Z\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to Z\\)</span> into a map whose codomain is the explicitly constructed set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{Y,Z}\">\\(F_{Y,Z}\\)</span> of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>-to-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> function graphs.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-map-currying-map</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,Z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq(X\\times Y)\\times Z","display":false},{"tex":"c\\subseteq X\\times Z^Y","display":false},{"tex":"F_{Y,Z}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_{Y,Z}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[F_{Y,Z}=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(Y\\times Z):\\mathrm{Function}(u,Y,Z)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X\\times Y,Z)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,X,F_{Y,Z})\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(c(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle))\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}currying\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFunCurryingMap}_S(c,f,X,Y,Z)","display":true},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to Z","display":false},{"tex":"F_{Y,Z}","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map.md|58-df-zfc-fun-currying-map]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","3579e07be41aa5cd"]}